@startuml
' Creole markup in every place text can go
title
  = Release notes
  Version **4.2** for //everyone//
end title
caption Figure 1: <i>markup</i> sampler
legend right
  |= Markup |= Result |
  | ""**bold**"" | **bold** |
  | ""//italic//"" | //italic// |
  | ""--struck--"" | --struck-- |
endlegend
participant Alice
participant Bob
Alice -> Bob : **bold** //italic// ""mono"" --struck-- __under__ ~~wave~~
Bob --> Alice : <b>b</b> <i>i</i> <u>u</u> <s>s</s> <color:red>red</color> <size:18>big</size>
Alice -> Bob : <back:yellow>marked</back> <font:courier>mono</font> H<sub>2</sub>O x<sup>2</sup>
Bob --> Alice : icons <&check> <&warning*2> emoji <:smile:> <:1f600:> <#green:sunny:>
Alice -> Bob : link [[https://plantuml.com]] and [[https://plantuml.com{tooltip} label]]
Bob --> Alice : line one\nline two\ttabbed <U+2713> &#169;
note over Alice, Bob
  = Heading
  == Sub-heading
  * item one
  ** nested //item//
  # numbered
  ----
  <code>
  code --> stays <b>literal</b>
  </code>
  Dates like 2026-01-01 and arrows like A -> B are plain text.
  A price of $5 is not a variable.
end note
@enduml
